917791015769_3204834042481983649_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qqV8hyNmueAQ7kNvwGrQpL0&_nc_oc=Adr2dvqrKfEd8LSr7XtYFt70181ZJjUkk31AGWVI1AfrHkEix2R6tLR-yYRqcCx8Z0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_I8uSjFNqqRaFpZRucCaH3WXVExBfNYvRA2ygFg9wUUA&oe=6A2AAE6E"}, {"file_name": "b84a56880b7e4bc59b1f73e1221f955c.png", "id": "1069948915158925", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_1069948918492258_6323477313382185656_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oSTkUr5WAt4Q7kNvwH_aaSX&_nc_oc=AdqTecRIbwom4_BeAIXxIkFXqzg1JGIUTLO0_Bs0-IlMQ6uHe11GPWdyg19Kk86LKK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8CT8yRw28Gr_HAvsT6h2pSrfnVZItZZfTQXYLniA7s9Q&oe=6A2ACA00"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "960759816919931", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298219_960759820253264_9196691632062401007_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jWm2lrJo4UgQ7kNvwH1o1qV&_nc_oc=AdrZuzgPtrkncRU6WMMF7dKubTzXLFgQCEPZsYcagMysx_58lATfbXEAh-XP7GDNm-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TXXqDPa2eFBtUXb2ch-cZKKvVA67NgWQQCV6Gl96bgQ&oe=6A2ABF49"}, "display_name": "10k Science", "keywords": ["education", "ai", "learning", "biology", "health"], "long_description": "# Step inside real science.\n\n10k Science turns real scientific research data into immersive VR worlds you can explore on Meta Quest.\n\nZoom from everyday life into cells, molecules, ecosystems, and hidden microscopic worlds. See how CRISPR can treat sickle cell disease. Investigate why vineyard plants are dying. Follow wildfire smoke into the lungs. Discover how tarantula venom could inspire new pain medicine. Explore how dolphins use sound to sense the world.\n\nThis is not a video or a textbook. It is an interactive science documentary you can step inside.\n\nYour AI science guide talks you through each experience, asks questions, and responds to your spoken answers as you explore.\n\n## Free download includes\n\n- **CRISPR & Sickle Cell**: Explore gene editing inside the human body.\n- **Trouble in Sunshine Creek**: Investigate a vineyard mystery involving invasive insects, plant disease, and microscopic biology.\n\n## Subscribe to unlock more\n\n- **Pain & Painkillers**: See how tarantula venom could inspire new ways to treat pain.\n- **Wildfire, Air Quality & Respiration**: Follow smoke from the air into the lungs.\n- **Seeing with Sound**: COMING SOON! Discover how porpoises and whales use sound to understand their surroundings.\n\nBuilt for curious minds who love science shows, museum exhibits, nature documentaries, biology, medicine, technology, and asking, \"wait, how does that actually work?\"\n\nSchools and organizations: contact us for classroom licensing.", "short_description": "Step inside real science in VR. Explore cells, molecules, wildfire smoke, CRISPR, animal venom, and dolphin echolocation in immersive worlds built from real scientific research data. Your AI science guide talks with you as you investigate hidden worlds that shape life on Earth."}]}, "developer_name": "Dynamoid, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dynamoid.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dynamoid, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://10k.science/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lang